/*
200 deeper and/or expressions, five to eight operators each, on six boolean
variables that may repeat, sometimes with not around a group. The shapes
were picked at random once (Python's random with the seed 20261123) and
are fixed here. Each is shown as a value and as an if condition for all 64
combinations of true and false (a first). Expected output worked out
separately.
*/
